OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog to tell public about new
OL,4,Ainspection plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders have been invited to see how
OL,7,Fthe Jersey Care Commission plans to
OL,8,Finspect hospital, ambulance and mental
OL,9,Fhealth provision from 2027.
OL,11,FA year ago the States Assembly approved
OL,12,Fwidening the remit of the commission to
OL,13,Finclude those departments, alongside
OL,14,Fcare services.
OL,16,FChief inspector Becky Sherrington said
OL,17,Fit would be working with the newly
OL,18,Fregulated organisations and it was not
OL,19,Fabout "catching people out".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
